  "answer": "D",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$U = \\frac{1}{2}LI^2 = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 2^2 = 8 \\times 10^{-6}\\ \\text{J} = 8\\ \\mu\\text{J}$$",
